(% class="legend-box" %)
**Legend:** (% style="color:#f1c40f" %)🏆 Best-in-slot(%%) · (% style="color:#7fdbff" %)⭐ Strong endgame(%%) · (% style="color:#b39ddb" %)🟣 Rare/Ex(%%) · (% style="color:#fff176" %)🟡 Rare(%%) · Links go to **bg-wiki.com**.

(% class="legend-box" %)
**SMN runs four sets.** Perpetuation -Cost (idle), Blood Pact (-BP Delay + Summoning Skill), HMP (resting between BPs), and Avatar Stat (boost the active avatar's attacks). Mythic Nirvana / Avatar's Favor changed the math — but staves are still the backbone.

{{toc/}}

----

= Trust Recommendations =

You BP DPS — Avatars / Apogee / Astral Conduit. Need: Tank, MP sustain (BPs drain fast), healer.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/August">August</a></strong></td><td>Tank — you stand back casting, need stable hate</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>🔮 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Koru-Moru">Koru-Moru</a></strong></td><td>**Refresh on casters (you!)** — SMN is MP-starved without it, Phalanx II on August</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Arciela">Arciela</a></strong></td><td>**Stacks 2nd Refresh** + Haste + Cure — BP spam fuel</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>Ballad adds third MP source, March on melee trusts</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Zeid_II">Zeid II</a></strong></td><td>Melee DPS + stun covers your long BP animations</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

